rtz/taskman/pull/5.patch","merged_at":"2025-04-21T14:32:17Z"},"body":"This update adds support for streaming task output (stdout and stderr) via a new StreamTaskOutput API.\r\n\r\nSummary\r\n- Introduced a TaskWriter component that buffers combined stdout/stderr output from each task.\r\n- Each connected client maintains a read offset into the shared output buffer and receives data in real time.\r\n- Streaming is designed to support multiple concurrent clients. A slow client will not block others.\r\n- Added integration tests to validate stream behavior, including full task output, mixed stdout/stderr, and client-side cancellations.\r\n\r\nAdditional Changes\r\n- Introduced a timeout around grpcServer.GracefulStop() to avoid indefinite blocking during shutdown, particularly when long-lived streaming RPCs are active.","closed_by":{"login":"mikewurtz","id":24414064,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NDE0MDY0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24414064?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikewurtz","html_url":"https://github.com/mikewurtz","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikewurtz/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikewurtz/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikewurtz/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikewurtz/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikewurtz/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikewurtz/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikewurtz/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikewurtz/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mikewurtz/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mikewurtz/taskman/issues/5/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.git